# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info
.eggs/

# Virtual environments. uv makes .venv; teammates on plain pip often name
# theirs venv/ or env/, so ignore those too rather than have one land in a PR.
.venv
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Printables generated on demand -- regenerate with the command, do not commit
# the output. The checked-in samples in tag-tracking/print/ are the exception.
/board.png
/field.png
/tag*.png

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NOT ignored, on purpose:
#   calib/intrinsics.json   shared: the team is on one rig. If you end up on
#                           different webcams, ignore it -- the loader only
#                           checks RESOLUTION and aspect ratio, so two cameras
#                           both at 640x480 would silently share one wrong fx.
